<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saturday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.88		 41.93</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	67.20		 67.30</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 25.50		 25.55</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.345		 0.347</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.16		 11.18</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.42		 11.44</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.10		  1.12</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 4.60 pct	    4.80 pct</p>
</text>
